How to configure a new codebase
Place the above values in your environment or configuration (e.g., .env):

Your code simply needs to:

Use ZOHO_API_DOMAIN as the base (https://desk.zoho.in/api/v1).
Refresh the access token when expired (via the refresh token).
Include orgId header and the refreshed token in every request.
Supply required fields (contactId, startTime, departmentId, etc.) when POSTing to /calls.
